{"id":"2b6a4a081d493b4c","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-turing-jump.md","title":"Turing Jump","display":"df-turing-jump — Turing Jump","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-turing-jump","aliases":["88-df-turing-jump"],"display":"df-turing-jump — Turing Jump","depends_on":["[[88-df-oracle-tm]]","[[88-df-oracle-computation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-turing-jump"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-turing-jump</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-turing-jump — Turing Jump"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"47142c2c72e0fb46\" href=\"?note=47142c2c72e0fb46\" title=\"88-df-oracle-tm\">88-df-oracle-tm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"baf8d9aebf7edfa1\" href=\"?note=baf8d9aebf7edfa1\" title=\"88-df-oracle-computation\">88-df-oracle-computation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb{N}\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (oracle set)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A&#39;\">\\(A&#39;\\)</span> (Turing jump)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_e^A\">\\(M_e^A\\)</span> (oracle machine with index <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"47142c2c72e0fb46\" href=\"?note=47142c2c72e0fb46\" title=\"88-df-oracle-tm\">88-df-oracle-tm</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e^A\">\\(\\varphi_e^A\\)</span> (partial function computed relative to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"baf8d9aebf7edfa1\" href=\"?note=baf8d9aebf7edfa1\" title=\"88-df-oracle-computation\">88-df-oracle-computation</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^{(n)}\">\\(A^{(n)}\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>) is the finite iterated jump defined below, including <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\emptyset^{(n)}\">\\(\\emptyset^{(n)}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}jump} \\vdash\nA&#39;\\coloneqq\n\\{e\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\langle e,y\\rangle\\in\\varphi_e^A)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}jump} \\vdash\nA&#39;\\coloneqq\n\\{e\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\langle e,y\\rangle\\in\\varphi_e^A)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}jump}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\quad A^{(0)}\\coloneqq A,\\qquad\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad A^{(n+1)}\\coloneqq(A^{(n)})&#39;\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}jump}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\quad A^{(0)}\\coloneqq A,\\qquad\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad A^{(n+1)}\\coloneqq(A^{(n)})&#39;\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Turing jump 是相对对角停机集</li>\n<li>Turing jump 产生更高的不可判定度</li>\n<li>Turing jump 形成无限序列</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-oracle-tm","status":"r